,"document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1525506007:1":{"text":"……まさか本当に、雨を止ませるとは。","source_cn":"……你真的阻止了降雨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBE199CE208C9697","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1525506008:1":{"text":"くどいぞ。","source_cn":"没必要把事实重复一遍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA37367B2B169D728","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1525506009:1":{"text":"貴様がホーリン城を危機から救ってくれたことは認めよう。","source_cn":"就事实而言，这次你确实帮助了呼临城，摩根。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x958CC6B7AD0505C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1525506010:1":{"text":"へえ、少しは物分かりがよくなったじゃないか。","source_cn":"嚯。想通了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x876F1565259AB134","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1525506011:0":{"text":"ビルボ先生！","source_cn":"比博老师……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0333EB79AB4BB425","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1525506012:1":{"text":"お前たちも忙しいだろうから引き留めはせんが、殿下の気持ちは受け取ってやってくれ。さて……私たちもやるべきことはたくさんありますぞ。","source_cn":"请收下殿下的感谢吧。呼临城仍有许多事务亟需处理，我们就...","status":"matched","h